msgstr "📲 نقل الحساب"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<b>Transfer Account</b>: <code>{phone}</code>\n"
"\n"
"Transferring an account moves its session and ownership to another user "
"in this bot, without requiring them to log in again.\n"
